# Everything in this repo is copied into a Linux container, so nothing here
# may ever be checked out with CRLF. s6 reads `s6-rc.d/*/type` byte for byte
# and rejects `oneshot\r` with "must be oneshot, longrun, or bundle", and a
# script whose shebang ends in \r fails to execute at all. A Windows clone
# with core.autocrlf=true silently produces both.
#
# text=auto still lets git leave real binaries alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
